<section id="packaging-manual-request" data-csrf="<%= csrf %>" data-request-key="<%= requestKey %>">
<div class="pr-heading"><div><h1>New Stock Requisition</h1><p class="muted">Main Warehouse မှ Packaging Warehouse သို့ ပစ္စည်းတောင်းခံရန်</p></div><a href="/packaging/material-request" class="pr-button pr-secondary">← Back to Requisitions</a></div>
<p id="prm-message" class="pr-alert" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
<div class="pr-requisition-layout"><div class="pr-requisition-items">
<div class="pr-manual-picker"><label for="prm-item"><strong>ITEM ရှာဖွေထည့်သွင်းရန်</strong><input id="prm-item" type="text" list="prm-catalog" placeholder="Item Code သို့မဟုတ် Item Name ဖြင့် ရှာပါ…" autocomplete="off"><datalist id="prm-catalog"><% for(const i of items){ %><option value="<%= (i.item_code||'မချိတ်ရသေးပါ')+' · '+i.item_name %>" data-id="<%= i.id %>" data-code="<%= i.item_code||'' %>" data-name="<%= i.item_name %>" data-category="<%= i.category %>" data-size="<%= i.size_ml||'' %>" data-stock="<%= i.closing_qty %>" data-main-stock="<%= i.main_stock==null?'':i.main_stock %>"></option><% } %></datalist></label><button type="button" id="prm-add">+ Add Item</button></div>
<section class="pr-requisition-list"><header><h2>Requisition Items List</h2><span id="prm-list-count">0 Items</span></header><div class="pr-table-wrap pr-manual-table"><table class="pr-table"><thead><tr><th>Product / Item Code</th><th>Packaging Stock</th><th>Main WH Stock</th><th>Request Qty</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="prm-rows"></tbody></table></div><div id="prm-empty" class="pr-requisition-empty"><span aria-hidden="true">◇</span><strong>တောင်းခံမည့် Item များ မရှိသေးပါ။</strong><p>အပေါ်ရှိ Search Box မှ Item Code သို့မဟုတ် နာမည်ဖြင့် ရှာပြီး ရွေးပါ။</p></div></section>
</div><aside class="pr-requisition-summary">
<section class="pr-route-card"><h2>STOCK TRANSFER ROUTE</h2><div class="pr-route"><div><small>FROM (SOURCE)</small><strong>Main Warehouse</strong></div><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><div><small>TO (DESTINATION)</small><strong>Packaging Warehouse</strong></div></div><p>Request တင်ရုံဖြင့် Stock မပြောင်းပါ။ Warehouse ထုတ်ပေးမှုအဆင့်တွင်မှ Stock ပြောင်းပါမည်။</p></section>
<label class="pr-needed" for="prm-needed">Needed By Date<input id="prm-needed" type="date" value="<%= today %>" required></label>
<fieldset class="pr-priority-picker"><legend>Priority Level</legend><div><label><input type="radio" name="prm-priority" value="NORMAL" checked><span>Normal</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="prm-priority" value="URGENT"><span>● Urgent</span></label></div></fieldset>
<label class="pr-manual-remark" for="prm-remark">Remark <span>(Optional)</span><textarea id="prm-remark" maxlength="500" rows="4" placeholder="တောင်းခံရသည့် အကြောင်းအရာ ရေးနိုင်ပါသည်…"></textarea></label>
<div class="pr-summary-totals"><div><span>Selected Items</span><strong id="prm-count">0 items</strong></div><div><span>Total Request Qty</span><strong id="prm-total">0 pcs</strong></div></div><button type="button" id="prm-submit" disabled>Submit Stock Requisition →</button>
</aside></div></section>
